Z||000003||Linx||11-21-1999||09:33 PM||||from pin 2, yellow wire <I>input</I> to the isolation relay.  which can be followed all the way back to the headlight switch (pin 6).<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Linx (edited 11-22-1999).]||||reg||1
